Hi Shanaya,

Jupyter notebooks are free for anyone to use. You can install them by installing miniconda (https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html).
After downloading the right script for your computer, run the following commands in bash/terminal:

bash Miniconda*.sh

and follow the steps.

Then run
conda config --add channels conda-forge
conda install jupyter notebook
jupyter notebook

A jupyter notebook should open in your browser.

Best,
Taylor

